      "kind": "inline",
      "title": "Give repeated cache failures their own event name",
      "body": "### Give repeated cache failures their own event name\n\n**Severity:** `low`\n\nThe first cache failure and subsequent failures use different event IDs, but both are named `LogCacheFailure`. A log query that filters by event name cannot select the first warning without also matching subsequent failures when Debug logging is enabled. Give the Debug event a distinct name while keeping its level and numeric ID unchanged.\n\n```suggestion\n        new EventId(2, \"LogSubsequentCacheFailure\"),\n```",
      "severity": "low"
    }
  ],
